                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44448f4a-850d-32e4-9659-9bfaf14dad1d",
                        "entry_id": "751b464e-fee5-3f48-8864-d07a7e63f412",
                        "glosses": [
                            "związany z aluzją; zawierający aluzje lub posługujący się aluzjami; będący aluzją"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1eb59c1c-972d-4a23-8a41-e9ee6917c71d",
                        "source_entry_id": "751b464e-fee5-3f48-8864-d07a7e63f412",
                        "source_sense_id": "44448f4a-850d-32e4-9659-9bfaf14dad1d",
                        "target_lang_word": "allusive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allusive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4c5ce1a-bad9-32d8-b511-bbab355f846e",
                                        "entry_id": "317fc0be-43b8-3a85-b3af-7dc7881c7fb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "that contains or makes use of allusions (indirect references or hints)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff51d179-133c-483d-b53a-572d2ec05920",
                                                "sense_id": "c4c5ce1a-bad9-32d8-b511-bbab355f846e",
                                                "text": "English poetry is compelled by the stubbornness of the language continually to renounce the too obviously poetic: but in seeking to be more precise, more dense and more allusive, Russian poetry has never had to give up the straightforward traditional intoxications of sound and rhyme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0514f56-9028-4254-a32d-81c9897a4956",
                                                "sense_id": "c4c5ce1a-bad9-32d8-b511-bbab355f846e",
                                                "text": "The footnotes ensure that the lines become more allusive and more polysemantic, vacillating between transubstantiation and ghostly intimations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc7b1feb-efb7-44d4-8e40-52b2ff6f7a00",
                                                "sense_id": "c4c5ce1a-bad9-32d8-b511-bbab355f846e",
                                                "text": "2013, Nick Nicholas, George Baloglou (translators and editors), Introduction, Unknown author, An Entertaining Tale of Quadrupeds, [14th c, Παιδιόφραστος διήγησις τῶν ζῴων τῶν τετραπόδων], page 87,\nThe Book is a more allusive work than the Tale, which leads to speculation on whether the digressions in both works might not merely be a case of a rambling narrator."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ab1e414-a250-4b00-9eaf-76ba87e8a1aa",
                                                "sense_id": "c4c5ce1a-bad9-32d8-b511-bbab355f846e",
                                                "text": "Around they go, taking in the poem's allusive system of images and its narrative density, the emotional heat of its subject matter, its increasing cultural salience re: women, re: trauma, re: bodies, re: life at the end of the world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f3340e90-808b-44f6-8d3b-95dac6fed8ee",
                        "source_entry_id": "751b464e-fee5-3f48-8864-d07a7e63f412",
                        "source_sense_id": "44448f4a-850d-32e4-9659-9bfaf14dad1d",
                        "target_lang_word": "allusif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allusif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8104abd0-16c5-3f15-bdaf-dc5d7dd06d45",
                                        "entry_id": "b5a7dfcf-adb8-3a48-9d65-ef0c90f021b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui contient une allusion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a75179d4-2c4c-4eb9-a2da-fb0b32f1655c",
                                                "sense_id": "8104abd0-16c5-3f15-bdaf-dc5d7dd06d45",
                                                "text": "Le ton péremptoire et l’expression allusive me glacèrent. J’eus le pressentiment d’une discussion immédiate et violente."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "052dd89b-dabb-4413-addb-a21a3aab0252",
                                                "sense_id": "8104abd0-16c5-3f15-bdaf-dc5d7dd06d45",
                                                "text": "Cette ambiguïté allusive est une réalisation du phénomène de l’intertextualité : elle fonctionne seulement si le récepteur dispose d’un bagage culturel suffisant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
